OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity of Aberdeen staff
OL,4,Aballoted on strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at the University of Aberdeen are
OL,7,Fbeing balloted on potential strike
OL,8,Faction in an ongoing dispute over job
OL,9,Fcuts.
OL,11,FA #10m savings plan - which could see
OL,12,Fmore than 100 jobs lost - was agreed
OL,13,Fearlier this year.
OL,15,FTalks between the University and
OL,16,FCollege Union (UCU) and the institution
OL,17,Fbroke down last month.
OL,19,FMembers of UCU are now being asked if
OL,20,Fthey are willing to take future strike
OL,21,Faction. The university has been asked
OL,22,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
